{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263wwtuCFO0D1793764218.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>有分析認為，港股近期的升市，成交均配合，相信指數有機會回升至24,000點水平。</p><p></p><p>高歌證券金融首席分析師聶振邦表示：「恒指目前來說於23,500點上落，相對過去三個月連跌的狀況，11月反彈的機會較為高一些。亦都見到恒指近日升市的時候，成交金額都是有一個向好的狀態，增加至約2,300億元的水平。所以先關注今個星期可否企穩於23,500點收市，若能企的話，後續再配合季績的利好因素，全個月來說，有機會看24,000點水平。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T05:04:59.585690+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T03:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T14:18:23.215448+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T04:58:32.325493+00:00","content_hash":"1fd8c62b0b7f4d43962bcd6b6f37f02711ac8a827fd6ef7b625d687b737ce4dc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T05:04:59.585690+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}